## 8. Target Users

### 8.1 Blockchain Developers

Developers who want to compose smart contract actions across chains without manually writing custom logic for every VM.

### 8.2 Protocol Teams

Teams that want safer cross-chain execution, stronger proof records, better route scoring, and refund-safe user flows.

### 8.3 Solvers

Actors who compete to fill user intents and earn fees.

### 8.4 Relayers

Actors who submit proofs, monitor events, and help advance intent states.

### 8.5 Auditors

Security reviewers who need a clear lifecycle of every cross-VM action.

### 8.6 Grant Programs

Ecosystems funding tooling, interoperability, AI, public goods, or security infrastructure.

### 8.7 AI Agents

AI systems that can draft, analyze, test, or explain `.x3` missions but cannot bypass deterministic safety checks.

