## 9.10 Cross-VM Adapter System

Each VM adapter must expose the same high-level behavior.

Required adapter interface:

```rust
trait X3VmAdapter {
    fn build_lock_tx();
    fn verify_lock();
    fn build_claim_tx();
    fn verify_claim();
    fn build_refund_tx();
    fn verify_refund();
    fn build_contract_call();
    fn decode_receipt();
    fn verify_finality();
    fn estimate_fees();
    fn estimate_risk();
}
```

Priority VM support:

| Priority | VM             | Chains                                                      |
| -------: | -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |
|        1 | EVM            | Ethereum, Base, Arbitrum, Optimism, Polygon, BNB, Avalanche |
|        2 | SVM            | Solana, Eclipse-style SVM chains                            |
|        3 | MoveVM         | Sui, Aptos                                                  |
|        4 | CosmWasm       | Cosmos appchains, Osmosis-style chains                      |
|        5 | Substrate/WASM | Polkadot, Kusama, parachains                                |
|        6 | CairoVM        | Starknet                                                    |
|        7 | Bitcoin Script | BTC HTLC/native swap paths                                  |
|        8 | TVM / TON      | TON ecosystem                                               |

