## 9.20 Scoreboard

The scoreboard must show real system status.

Required scoreboard categories:

| Category            | Score                             |
| ------------------- | --------------------------------- |
| VM adapter health   | pass/fail/partial                 |
| Chain health        | live/degraded/halted              |
| RPC quorum health   | strong/weak/broken                |
| Solver reliability  | percentage                        |
| Relayer reliability | percentage                        |
| Route safety        | 0-100                             |
| Refund safety       | 0-100                             |
| Finality confidence | 0-100                             |
| Test coverage       | percentage                        |
| Stub/mock count     | must be zero for production paths |
| Proof completeness  | percentage                        |
| Mainnet readiness   | pass/fail                         |

Every score must link to:

```text
tests
proofs
logs
chain evidence
adapter status
CI results
```

No manual scoreboard inflation is allowed.

