## 9.21 Slashing and Disputes

X3 must hold solvers and relayers accountable.

Slashable offenses:

```text
fake fill
fake finality
missed committed fill
invalid proof
withheld preimage
late execution
route substitution
RPC manipulation
double-submit fraud
false relayer report
```

Required dispute flow:

```text
dispute opened
evidence submitted
proof ledger checked
challenge window observed
fault determined
bond slashed or dispute rejected
scoreboard updated
```

